    "masked_text":  "[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00001:62d3f4d4fff1]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00002:d4db39f19416]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00003:a98260149c8d]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00004:d4b8e31ff7f6]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00005:09c3204aa359]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00006:79093c7d0552]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00007:434d74a0521c]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00008:16408e54b12a]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00009:d61c0cb6718d]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00010:1200f9a78ca8]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00011:a1124280438d]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00012:8eba1f36b5ab]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00013:1a3f396b0724]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00014:f45440a1a7c9]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00015:0efc806c7e6e]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00016:a667df9de59f]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00017:e364010d0999]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00018:85e317be1d3e]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00019:adfa185343d9]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00020:ed31493106fd]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00021:72573b85a6ba]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00022:926f9ce690ad]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00023:49d34b0366eb]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00024:66cd782567ce]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00025:049d0a6a9cf4]]\n这份报告是本队现阶段训练的结算记录。第一部分依照思维导图和三人分工，整理了十三个\n算法与模型学习单元，把原理、求解步骤、代码入口和使用边界放在一起核对；第二部分选取\n2024年A题一等奖论文A053《基于目标优化的板凳龙形态调节》，细看摘要、假设、建模、\n求解、结果解释和附录怎样前后接续。读论文时反复用到的检查办法，最后收进本队的\n章节模板。文中的[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00026:cd6c2b7a0f47]]指目前能够复述原理、讲明步骤并列出代码逻辑，不等同于已经\n完成全部算法的限时独立复现。\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00027:bc660fe2b728]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00028:0de19e109b32]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00029:b8f1bc1dff58]]数学建模；学习笔记；板凳龙；论文结构；写作模板\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00030:d87bde9aac5f]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00031:a9a485c98291]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00032:94f4686f5661]]\n\n",
